---
// src/components/sections/Hero.astro
---

<section class="relative pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-40 lg:pb-28 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center border-b border-white/5">
	<div
		class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[520px] h-[520px] bg-brand-accent/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] -z-10 pointer-events-none"
		aria-hidden="true"
	></div>

	<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 text-center z-10">
		<p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 mb-6 text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest">
			Web. Mobile. Applied AI.
		</p>

		<h1 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-6 leading-tight">
			Software built around your next business move.
		</h1>

		<p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 mb-10 leading-relaxed prose-measure">
			Zetalogix helps businesses design, build and improve digital products. From customer-facing websites and mobile apps to internal platforms and AI tools, we turn your requirements into a clear plan and a focused delivery process.
		</p>

		<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
			<a
				href="/contact"
				data-astro-prefetch="hover"
				class="cta-primary w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-cyan-400 hover:bg-cyan-300 text-slate-950 font-semibold rounded-full text-sm"
			>
				Discuss Your Project
			</a>
			<a
				href="#services"
				class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-white/5 text-white font-semibold rounded-full border border-white/15 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/25 transition-colors duration-150 text-sm"
			>
				Explore Our Services
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>